# Demonic Junker: "If a creature you controlled was destroyed this way, put two +1/+1 counters on this Vehicle": Bot1 takes only
# their own Memnite and none of Bot2's. Memnite dies, the Junker gets two counters and Bot2's Ornithopter is left alone. Bot1
# has Mox Jet and Memnite as artifacts (Black Lotus is sacrificed for mana), so the Junker costs {4}{B}: Lotus, Jet and a Swamp.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Memnite
Demonic Junker
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Plains x5
Plains x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Demonic Junker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Demonic Junker.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Ornithopter
